[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566523365","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100945#issuecomment-2566523365","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100945","id":2566523365,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-gnl","user":{"login":"RealMadvicius","id":77865890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODY1ODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77865890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius","html_url":"https://github.com/RealMadvicius","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T15:09:53Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T15:09:53Z","body":"Let me know if I have correctly understood the issue.\n\nIf you have a script opened in the script editor and that you edit it externaly with for example Notepad++, the editor detects a change of the file and will prompt you about it and reload the file.\n\nIf you have a script that isnt opened in the editor BUT you externaly edit, you wont have any notification of change made to the file that wasnt opened in the editor.\n\nSo in the second case mentioned, if you then open the script in the godot editor after editing it externaly, is it containing the updated content or does it look like a older cached version of the file ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566523365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566579446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100945#issuecomment-2566579446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100945","id":2566579446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-uT2","user":{"login":"dog-on-moon","id":159832633,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYbaOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159832633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/dog-on-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T16:35:47Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T16:35:47Z","body":"An older cached version of the file is indeed used.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566579446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566611401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100945#issuecomment-2566611401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100945","id":2566611401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-2HJ","user":{"login":"RealMadvicius","id":77865890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODY1ODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77865890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius","html_url":"https://github.com/RealMadvicius","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealMadvicius/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T17:27:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T17:27:17Z","body":"So the issue seems that:\n\n-  the editor deploys listenners for file changes only for opened files ( most likely to save on performance and resources )\n-  the editor \"preload\" all scripts into a cache at project load moment and after that only work into a diff / incremental way to detect live changes\n\nI can think of these possible solutions:\n\n- have listenners always created and listenning for any changes done to any dependencies of the project and reload any changed ones ( scripts, resources, addons, etc... ) => extremely accurate monitoring of changes but in same time very aggressive on system resources usage\n- have the editor to always reload from storage instead of cache => solve the issue of continuous resource usage but can have a big impact on big projects with massive files which would take ages to load , imagine for example changing one file that is a dependency of another set of massive files, it would mean potentialy that we have to reload not only the changed one but also the others\n- maybe base the detection and need for a reload against a checksum, if a loaded file of the project ( but not opened ) checksum is different from the checksum of the file on the storage drive then compute which set of files have to be reloaded including this one too\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566611401/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802787335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100945#issuecomment-2802787335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100945","id":2802787335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nDyQH","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.